---
/**
 * A legal page in the Level Select style: the title level in navy, the sections as navy rows on
 * a blue field, and the ways to reach me on green. Sections come in through the slot as
 * <section class="row"> blocks so each page keeps its own words.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Join from './Join.astro';
import { contact, legal } from '../config';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  kicker: string;
  lead: string;
  updated?: string;
}
const { title, description, kicker, lead, updated = legal.updated } = Astro.props;
const updatedText = new Date(updated).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' });
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="level level--navy level--sky has-join-bottom legal" data-level="1" aria-labelledby="legal-title">
    <p class="flag" data-load style="--d: 0ms"><span>{kicker}</span></p>
    <div class="legal__head">
      <h1 id="legal-title" class="page__title legal__title">
        <span class="mask"><span class="mask__line" style="--i: 0">{title}</span></span>
      </h1>
      <div class="legal__aside" data-load style="--d: 300ms">
        <p class="legal__lead statement">{lead}</p>
        <p class="legal__updated">Last updated {updatedText}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Join kind="clouds" from="var(--pr-navy)" to="var(--field-blue)" seed={`legal-${title}`} />
  </section>

  <section class="level level--blue has-join-bottom legal__body" data-level="2" aria-label={`${title}, the details`}>
    <Join kind="terrain" from="var(--field-blue)" to="var(--field-green)" seed={`legal-ask-${title}`} />
    <p class="flag" data-enter><span>Level 2 &middot; The details</span></p>
    <div class="legal__rows rows">
      <slot />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="level level--green has-join-bottom legal__ask" data-level="3" aria-labelledby="legal-ask-title">
    <Join kind="terrain" from="var(--field-green)" to="var(--pr-navy)" seed={`legal-foot-${title}`} />
    <div class="level__head">
      <p class="flag" data-enter><span>Level 3 &middot; Questions</span></p>
      <h2 id="legal-ask-title" class="level__title" data-enter="wipe">Questions about this page</h2>
      <p class="level__lead" data-enter style="--enter-delay: 80ms">
        {legal.controller}{legal.address ? `, ${legal.address}` : `, ${contact.location}`}.
      </p>
      <a class="legal__mail" href={`mailto:${contact.email}`} data-enter style="--enter-delay: 160ms">{contact.email}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal {
    padding-top: var(--s-2);
  }
  .legal__head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr;
    gap: var(--s-5);
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: var(--s-5);
  }
  .legal__title {
    font-size: round(clamp(3rem, 1rem + 7vw, 9rem), 16px);
  }
  .legal__aside {
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .legal__lead {
    max-width: 36ch;
  }
  .legal__updated {
    margin-top: var(--s-3);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    max-width: none;
  }
  .legal__rows {
    margin-top: var(--s-5);
    max-width: 64rem;
  }
  .legal__rows :global(.row h2) {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }
  .legal__rows :global(.row p),
  .legal__rows :global(.row li) {
    max-width: 62ch;
  }
  .legal__rows :global(.row ul) {
    list-style: square;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: var(--s-1);
  }
  .legal__rows :global(.row li + li) {
    margin-top: 0.4em;
  }
  .legal__rows :global(.row a) {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .legal__mail {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--pr-navy);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  @media (max-width: 63.99rem) {
    .legal__head {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--s-4);
      margin-top: var(--s-4);
    }
    .legal__title {
      font-size: round(15vw, 8px);
    }
  }
</style>
